hqTabs:
Two tabs: "Store Managers" (id StoreManagers, nl "Filiaalmanagers") and "Team Leiders" (id TeamLeaders, nl "Teamleiders").

HARMONY: exactly one required patch — Postfix on BizManBusiness.SetUpTabs (private void, GLOBAL namespace, main assembly). Cache once via AccessTools: fMenu=Field("menu"), fContainers=Field("containers"), fTabs=Field("_tabs"), mSetTab=Method("SetTab",new[]{typeof(string)}). Postfix(BizManBusiness __instance):
  a. if (!HarmonyBootstrap.BizManTabsActive) return;
  b. reg=__instance.buildingRegistration; isHq = reg!=null && reg.RentedByPlayer && reg.businessTypeName=="ba:businesstype_headquarters";
  c. menu/containers/tabs = the three fields' values;
  d. foreach id in {"StoreManagers","TeamLeaders"} (TeamLeaders only from Phase C):
       btn = menu.Find(id);
       if (isHq) { if (btn==null) btn = BuildTab(__instance, menu, containers, id);
                   if (!tabs.Contains(id)) tabs.Insert(tabs.IndexOf("PurchasingAgents")+offset, id);   // MUST insert into _tabs — BizManBusiness.cs:166 kicks the user off a tab not in _tabs
                   btn.gameObject.SetActive(true); }                                                      // stock SetUpTabs trailing loop already hid it
       else if (btn!=null) btn.gameObject.SetActive(false);
BuildTab: proto = menu.Find("PurchasingAgents"); go = Object.Instantiate(proto.gameObject, menu); go.name=id; go.transform.SetSiblingIndex(proto.GetSiblingIndex()+offset); go.GetComponent<TextLocalizationComponent>().SetValue-or-.Key = "sm:bizmantab_"+id; b=go.GetComponent<Button>(); b.onClick.RemoveAllListeners(); b.onClick.AddListener(() => mSetTab.Invoke(__instance, new object[]{id}));  // stock SetTab fully services a correctly-named child; its switch has no manager-tab case, no SetTab patch needed
  container: clone RectTransform of containers.Find("PurchasingAgents") -> new GameObject(id) under containers, copy anchors/pivot/sizeDelta, SetActive(false), AddComponent<StoreManagerTabView>() (or TeamLeaderTabView).
OPTIONAL Postfix on BizManBusiness.Awake — pre-build so there's no one-open flicker; not required (SetUpTabs self-heals every open, and is the only choke point — 3 call sites all in BizManBusiness.cs, no external callers, re-run on every open AND every business switch).

RUNTIME TAB UI (no bundle): UI/StoreManagerTabView.cs / UI/TeamLeaderTabView.cs are MonoBehaviours; OnEnable builds ScrollRect -> Viewport -> Content(VerticalLayoutGroup + ContentSizeFitter) and reads ManagerDirectory.Active. Store Managers tab: a manager-pick dropdown (GameApi.GetManagerCandidates), capped per-store toggle rows, per-store budget/target-days sliders — the exact same ManagerDirectory actions the ModOptions panel calls. Team Leiders tab: per store, department list, TL assignment, product-membership multi-toggle.

IDEMPOTENCY: existence-checked BuildTab, if(!tabs.Contains(id)) before Insert, unconditional SetActive — safe on every re-entry.
BUILD GATE: HarmonyBootstrap gates the whole BizMan patch set on GameVersion.GetCurrent().buildNumber in [3600,3899] (fallback SaveGameManager.Current.buildNumberAtStart) AND all four reflection handles non-null. Outside window / any null handle -> BizManTabsActive=false, log once, skip the patch.
GRACEFUL FALLBACK: the existing UI/StoreManagerOptions.cs panel (Options -> Mods) stays permanently as the full-feature fallback UI. When the tab is live the panel shows a one-line "managed from BizMan -> HQ" note but keeps every control working. If BuildTab throws mid-build, catch, DestroyImmediate the partial GameObjects, set BizManTabsActive=false — panel is the UI.
